      &lt;Condition&gt;[h_isEdit] &amp;amp;&amp;amp; ![HasRole:Admins] &amp;amp;&amp;amp; ![HasRole:CitizenDevelopers] &amp;amp;&amp;amp; ![HasRole:Low-CodeEngineer] &amp;amp;&amp;amp; ![HasRole:Managers]&lt;/Condition&gt;
